ovember 12, 2015 |publisher=[[TV Tonight]]}}</ref> however it was pushed back until January 22.<ref>{{Cite web |last=Purcell |first=Chuck |date=December 24, 2015 |title=New In January: 200+ shows including DC's Legends Of Tomorrow, Andrew Winter's Tiny House & more |url=http://community.foxtel.com.au/t5/Foxtel-Blog/New-In-January-200-shows-including-DC-s-Legends-Of-Tomorrow/ba-p/106619 |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20160103045859/http://community.foxtel.com.au/t5/Foxtel-Blog/New-In-January-200-shows-including-DC-s-Legends-Of-Tomorrow/ba-p/106619 |archive-date=January 3, 2016 |access-date=January 3, 2016 |publisher=The Green Room}}</ref> It started airing in the United Kingdom on March 3, 2016.<ref>{{Cite web |last=Ritman |first=Alex |date=November 25, 2015 |title=DC's 'Legends of Tomorrow' Docks With Sky in U.K. |url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/news/general-news/sky-takes-legends-tomorrow-uk-843856/ |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20151126134506/http://www.hollywoodreporter.com/news/sky-takes-legends-tomorrow-uk-843856 |archive-date=November 26, 2015 |access-date=March 22, 2022 |website=[[The Hollywood Reporter]]}}</ref> This show also aired on [[CTV Sci-Fi Channel]] in Canada.<ref>{{Cite web |title=DC's Legends of Tomorrow-CTV |url=https://www.ctv.ca/shows/dcs-legends-of-tomorrow |url-status=dead |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20200820231929/https://www.ctv.ca/shows/dcs-legends-of-tomorrow |archive-date=August 20, 2020 |access-date=January 16, 2021}}</ref>

